OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's share price has dropped
OL,7,Fback towards its initial public
OL,8,Foffering (IPO) price a day after its
OL,9,Fsoaring market debut, as the broader
OL,10,Ftech sell off continues.
OL,12,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,13,Fcompany's introduction to the Nasdaq
OL,14,Fstock exchange on Thursday was a
OL,15,Fcrucial test for the industry and was
OL,16,Flargely seen as a success, with trading
OL,17,Fstarting at $111.50.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
